-------------------------------------- HTTP ----------------------------------------------------------

- FETCH DATA OVER HTTP FROM THE PONYRACER REST API.

- Instruction: Angular Prerequisite "Http" chapter

1️⃣ Now let’s try to get real data from a web server.
    To do that, we will use a REST API that we have created and that is available at
    https://ponyracer.ninja-squad.com. The documentation of this API is available here
    (https://ponyracer.ninja-squad.com/apidoc).
    Use the HttpClient service in RaceService to get the list of pending races. 


2️⃣ The resource that we’re interested in right now is the one that allows getting the list of
    pending races.
    Hint: the get method accept options as a second parameter. You can use these options to add
    query parameters to the URL with { params: { status: 'PENDING' } }.


